But we have to keep a good shape.

12
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:04,600
So training is a big part too.

13
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:12,040
Late obviously a sense of freedom

14
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,440
to get to rush forward

15
